{
    "title": "Tango- Live Stream, Video Chat",
    "description": "Tango is a LIVE social community with over 500M users around the world where you can connect with new friends, go live, and watch talented Creators 24/7!\r\n\r\nIt's the ultimate platform to make real connections, engage in live video chats, and join the new wave of social communication.\r\n\r\nExplore, watch, chat, and use our live video streams to make lasting friendships and build your community. \r\nWhether you want to meet new friends, discover unique content, or support your favorite Creators, Tango is the place to be!\r\n\r\nWhy Tango?\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0d Global Community: Connect with people worldwide and discover a diverse, creative community. Tango is where communities are formed - THE place to make new friends.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf9 Live Video Chats: Enjoy real-time video chats with friends and creators. Our live chat features allow you to interact and share moments as they happen.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd33\ud83c\udffb Live Streaming: Stream your special moments, watch content you\u2019ll love, and live video chat with your favorite Creators. Become a part of the live-streaming revolution and make real friends through engaging content.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Creator & Fan Community: Tango enables creators to build their community and connect with fans like never before. Discover and support talented Creators by watching their incredible streams. \r\n\r\nJoin Us If You:\r\n* Want to watch live streams and interact with hosts in real-time\r\n* Enjoy online music concerts and social hangs\r\n* Like chatting with people from around the world\r\n* Watch gaming live streams and discussing strategies \r\n* Are interested in becoming an influencer by showcasing their talents\r\n* Like to support others who work hard for their dreams\r\n* Love luxury goods and unique gifts\r\n* Are looking to find new friends and build real connections\r\n* Want to explore new trendy content and discover talented Creators\r\n* Enjoy exciting and interactive live audio chats\r\n* Want to experience seamless real-time translation for easy communication with people all over the world!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Try NEW Audio Rooms: Exciting and Interactive! Chat live, share ideas, and connect with your community. Create your space, invite listeners, and have fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc91 Introducing Tango Match: Discover live dates with Tango Match and connect with new friends in an exciting and interactive way.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udde3\ufe0fLive Video Chat: Connect 1-on-1 or create group video chats with up to 9 people. Meet locals or discover friends from around the globe. Enjoy fun video chats with interactive face filters.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd33\ud83c\udffb VLOG (Video Blog): Share your life, talents, and experiences. Grow your following and become a popular vlogger on Tango!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Gaming: Stream or watch popular games. Join the excitement and connect with other gaming enthusiasts in our community!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0d Support for Multiple Languages & Real-Time Translation We support the app in English, Hindi, Arabic, Spanish, French, Russian, Vietnamese, Telugu, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Urdu, Uzbek, Welsh, Xhosa, Yiddish, Bosnian, Bulgarian, Burmese, Catalan, Chinese, Chuvash, Croatian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Esperanto, Estonian, Finnish, Galician, Georgian, German, Greek, Gujarati, Haitian Creole, Hebrew, Hungarian, Icelandic, Indonesian, Irish, Italian, Japanese, Javanese, Kannada, Persian, Polish, Portuguese, Punjabi, Romanian, Scottish Gaelic, Serbian, Sinhala, Slovak, Slovenian, Sundanese, Swahili, Swedish, Tagalog, Tajik, Tamil, and Tatar. \r\n\r\nNo worries about language barriers - our real-time translation makes it easy to connect with everyone!\r\n\r\nJoin millions of satisfied users who have found friends and community on Tango. Our users love the interactive features and the ability to connect with people worldwide.\r\n\r\nYour feedback helps us improve!\r\nAny Questions? Please contact us at support@tango.me \r\n\r\nJoin the Tango Community! It's time to make real connections, build your community, and join the largest live-streaming platform!\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@tangoapp/featured \r\nTwitter: https://x.com/TangoMe\r\n\r\nDownload Tango now and join the fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tango is a LIVE social community with over 500M users around the world where you can connect with new friends, go live, and watch talented Creators 24/7!<br><br>It&#39;s the ultimate platform to make real connections, engage in live video chats, and join the new wave of social communication.<br><br>Explore, watch, chat, and use our live video streams to make lasting friendships and build your community. <br>Whether you want to meet new friends, discover unique content, or support your favorite Creators, Tango is the place to be!<br><br>Why Tango?<br><br>\ud83c\udf0d Global Community: Connect with people worldwide and discover a diverse, creative community. Tango is where communities are formed - THE place to make new friends.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf9 Live Video Chats: Enjoy real-time video chats with friends and creators. Our live chat features allow you to interact and share moments as they happen.<br><br>\ud83e\udd33\ud83c\udffb Live Streaming: Stream your special moments, watch content you\u2019ll love, and live video chat with your favorite Creators. Become a part of the live-streaming revolution and make real friends through engaging content.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Creator &amp; Fan Community: Tango enables creators to build their community and connect with fans like never before. Discover and support talented Creators by watching their incredible streams. <br><br>Join Us If You:<br>* Want to watch live streams and interact with hosts in real-time<br>* Enjoy online music concerts and social hangs<br>* Like chatting with people from around the world<br>* Watch gaming live streams and discussing strategies <br>* Are interested in becoming an influencer by showcasing their talents<br>* Like to support others who work hard for their dreams<br>* Love luxury goods and unique gifts<br>* Are looking to find new friends and build real connections<br>* Want to explore new trendy content and discover talented Creators<br>* Enjoy exciting and interactive live audio chats<br>* Want to experience seamless real-time translation for easy communication with people all over the world!<br><br>Features:<br>\ud83c\udfa7 Try NEW Audio Rooms: Exciting and Interactive! Chat live, share ideas, and connect with your community. Create your space, invite listeners, and have fun!<br><br>\ud83d\udc91 Introducing Tango Match: Discover live dates with Tango Match and connect with new friends in an exciting and interactive way.<br><br>\ud83d\udde3\ufe0fLive Video Chat: Connect 1-on-1 or create group video chats with up to 9 people. Meet locals or discover friends from around the globe. Enjoy fun video chats with interactive face filters.<br><br>\ud83e\udd33\ud83c\udffb VLOG (Video Blog): Share your life, talents, and experiences. Grow your following and become a popular vlogger on Tango!<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Gaming: Stream or watch popular games. Join the excitement and connect with other gaming enthusiasts in our community!<br><br>\ud83c\udf0d Support for Multiple Languages &amp; Real-Time Translation We support the app in English, Hindi, Arabic, Spanish, French, Russian, Vietnamese, Telugu, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Urdu, Uzbek, Welsh, Xhosa, Yiddish, Bosnian, Bulgarian, Burmese, Catalan, Chinese, Chuvash, Croatian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Esperanto, Estonian, Finnish, Galician, Georgian, German, Greek, Gujarati, Haitian Creole, Hebrew, Hungarian, Icelandic, Indonesian, Irish, Italian, Japanese, Javanese, Kannada, Persian, Polish, Portuguese, Punjabi, Romanian, Scottish Gaelic, Serbian, Sinhala, Slovak, Slovenian, Sundanese, Swahili, Swedish, Tagalog, Tajik, Tamil, and Tatar. <br><br>No worries about language barriers - our real-time translation makes it easy to connect with everyone!<br><br>Join millions of satisfied users who have found friends and community on Tango. Our users love the interactive features and the ability to connect with people worldwide.<br><br>Your feedback helps us improve!<br>Any Questions? Please contact us at support@tango.me <br><br>Join the Tango Community! It&#39;s time to make real connections, build your community, and join the largest live-streaming platform!<br>YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@tangoapp/featured <br>Twitter: https://x.com/TangoMe<br><br>Download Tango now and join the fun!",
